Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.40,Chinese,C06-06-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}分兵或合军后，重新读原军与新队。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.40,English,C06-06-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}After splitting or merging, reread the original army and any new detachment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:11.30,Chinese,C06-06-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}兵团归属是否完整，当前与满员人数是否守恒，库存和容量分别变成什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:11.30,English,C06-06-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}Check every regiment's assignment, conservation of current and maximum soldiers,\Nand the resulting stock and capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:15.86,Chinese,C06-06-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}新队库存暂时高于容量，就按实际值保存。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:15.86,English,C06-06-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}If the new army temporarily has more stock than capacity, preserve the actual value.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:21.50,Chinese,C06-06-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}统帅没读到时保持未知，不从容量或头像猜一个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:21.50,English,C06-06-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}If the commander is unread,\Nkeep that identity unknown rather than infer it from capacity or a portrait.
